380
00:23:34.955 --> 00:23:36.081
Diam, bodoh.

381
00:23:36.165 --> 00:23:37.666
Anda harus tahu kapan harus berhenti.

382
00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.627
Kami hanya pedagang.

383
